{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_04_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_04","title":"安魂教堂","storyCode":"GA-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"4633f10883ee162dc85b34c9eb46e428e4b0283e3324d5010b1518c9c10dec29","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多和我讲些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，小心手上的蜡烛，别烫着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！不能捏坏形状......不然就不好看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了妈妈......我要做得完美一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我讲得已经够多的了。无非是无聊的冒险，寻常的生活。至于传说中的卡兹戴尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来惭愧，我们都没有去过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的卡兹戴尔......一定就像萨科塔的拉特兰一样吧！是萨卡兹们的家乡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人都开开心心的，也会有棉花糖车吧？还有点心店......大街上会有好多高高兴兴的萨卡兹，大家互相打招呼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终有一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该说说你了，塞茜莉亚。你的爸爸妈妈是什么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其实，我也不太清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见到爸爸的次数很少......每次要见爸爸的时候，妈妈就会准备很久，带着我在晚上出门，走很远很远......走到树林里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在森林里见面，爸爸总是穿着厚厚的斗篷，似乎刚从遥远的地方赶过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实不太记得爸爸的长相，但我记得爸爸的角！漆黑又笔直，在月亮下闪闪发光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会牵着我的手在树林的边缘散步，告诉我每一棵树的种类和年龄......城外的晚上好安静，连羽兽的叫声都没有，但我一点也不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸老是紧紧牵着我的手，其实会有一点点疼......但我不想告诉他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次见到爸爸，我觉得爸爸比我还要高兴......！好像也有点......紧张？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走累了，妈妈就会背着我回家。我回头，就会看到爸爸站在高高的树下面，一直看着我们，走了很远很远，他还站在那里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爸爸妈妈都是了不起的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得妈妈可厉害了！她什么都会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你看，这是妈妈的守护铳，艾泽尔哥哥放在我这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈说，爸爸根本打不过她......她都是让着爸爸呢！不过我想爸爸也应该很厉害，嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈塞茜莉亚，我说的“了不起”和你说的“厉害”，可能不是同一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？那爸爸妈妈一定又了不起又厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，妈妈从来不和我讲她和爸爸认识的故事，我每次想问，稀里糊涂地就被妈妈绕去说别的了......为什么妈妈不告诉我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当我们还小的时候啊，更重要的事情还有很多。你喜欢看泡茶吗，我小时候可喜欢看泡茶啦，茶水的颜色一层一层地变化......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗塞菈姐姐，你现在绕开话题的样子，和妈妈就很像哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其实我也不是什么都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天我在城里跑了好多地方，除了你，一个萨卡兹都没见到......萨卡兹，不能来拉特兰，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以爸爸和妈妈也不应该在一起......不对，我是想说，是不是有人不让爸爸妈妈在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没有什么不应该在一起......这些一定会改变的。不会很久......总有一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相爱没有罪过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就是为此来到这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那一天，我也可以在拉特兰的大街上随便乱逛了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再也不用偷偷藏在房间里？那拉特兰每一家糖果店我都可以去一次吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次哪里够呀，塞茜莉亚喜欢去多少次就去多少次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......真希望那一天快点来......好想快点长大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，如果你快快长大，也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，塞茜莉亚，我们不用那么着急。我小时候，总觉得等长大了，什么烦恼都可以解决掉。可是，等到真的长大了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长大是一件非常非常非常辛苦的事，塞茜莉亚，对你来说更是这样，你肩负着......不，算了。你还小，别去想这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可每个人都会长大呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，我们没有选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一直微笑着的罗塞菈露出了有些落寞的神情。\n她看向小教堂的窗外，外面是开满鲜花的墓园，再远处，隐约可见高踞于拉特兰城中心的圣像。\n她轻轻哼起了歌。忧伤，又依稀带着希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是这首歌！昨天碰到罗塞菈姐姐的时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈教我这首歌的时候说，歌词她记不清楚了，就用啦啦啦代替了。可是曲调真的好好听......本来的歌词，是讲什么的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是萨卡兹的歌，歌词讲的是一个英雄，他要出发去做了不起的事情啦，人们就唱歌和他告别，送他启程，愿他平安归来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌里面唱啊，英雄就要出发啦，沿着通往远方的路，去实现他的梦想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许路途遥远，但一定，一定......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥，修士先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在聊什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先导，日安——都是些有的没的，萨卡兹以前的故事啦，再说说家常话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有意思了......我从来没和人聊过这么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥，这是你摘的花吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我想，也许可以萃取一下，给蜡烛加上香味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"香气可以指引离去之人的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，谢谢艾泽尔哥哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......艾泽尔哥哥，其实......我其实......有点害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葬礼......和妈妈道别......就是真的最后一次道别了，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的再也不能见了？就算过节也不行吗？或者......和爸爸一样，很久见一次......是不是也不行？就算......只是摸摸头也不行......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......就算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......还有一个天使和驮兽的故事，没有讲完......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是最后一晚了，塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚，今天晚上，我陪你待在妈妈的房间吧，我们都会陪你。你们不会孤独。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹为一对萨科塔母女守夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烛火虽弱，亦能照亮彼岸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g7_laterano_ward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，我们又来看你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你带了点甜点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从大教堂顺出来的水果挞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎。顺便一提，上面的仙人掌看起来很难吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是你，蕾缪安，眼神真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，你们有这么想我，到了要每天来看我一次的程度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是需要，我们每个小时来看你也可以啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，你在献殷勤吗？至于菲亚梅塔......笑得很勉强哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你遇到他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰混进了萨卡兹，而我在追捕萨卡兹的时候......正面撞上了他的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗，没受伤就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，你在这里没问题吗？毕竟只是普通医院，万一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经来过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"病房中一时寂静。\n蕾缪安看向桌上的瓶花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说起他的态度，简直就像在谈论周末的野餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，我不想和你生气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但唯独在这件事上......无论是你，还是莫斯提马，每一次，每一次，我提起那时的事情，你们就会露出一样的表情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你们的样子，我会觉得......好像那天发疯的人不是他，而是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们只是感受到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你们萨科塔那一套？好，你感受到了，那你又为什么向他举铳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两回事。不论他当时有多......我也不可能让他夺走锁与匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之后呢？他害得你堕天了......！你就这样无所谓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，他的源石技艺，把你伤成这样，在病床上昏迷了五年......你也无所谓吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，我们是与你一边的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我确实能感受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想再听到这个词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是不是觉得，我的生气很多余？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢，菲亚梅塔，我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对的，当然了，你们都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我不明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，菲亚梅塔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，菲亚梅塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"微光守夜人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"揍你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听我说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，我告诉你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了，我再也受不了你们这些混蛋萨科塔了！什么共感，什么互相理解！我根本就不想懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光环是把你们这些天使的脑子烧坏了吗？你和蕾缪安，差点死在那片废墟里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们为什么不生气？你们为什么不愤怒？为什么只有我......我的愤怒格格不入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再给我摆那种故作高深的笑脸，说起什么都无所谓的态度！你不得不离开拉特兰，到处奔波，风餐露宿，居无定所，是拜谁所赐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一路跟着你到维多利亚，到莱塔尼亚，到萨尔贡，到炎国......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为到底是为了什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，蕾缪安，安多恩......我们的小队。我们有过那么......相互信任的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有什么了不得的苦衷？他凭什么背叛这些信任？你们凭什么要理解他？我又为什么要理解他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我有多舍不得那段日子......？每一次有惊无险地完成任务......每一次蕾缪安带我们去喝酒......每一次我们去试新开的甜品店......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至每一次他帮大家改报告......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有什么理由，就随手毁了这一切......？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的日子，我是在乎的啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰的鸢尾花。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只长在圣马尔索中心花园、夕辉礼拜堂和司提望区安魂教堂这几个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我们一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可是我的监视者，可别让我受伤了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
